   "lines": [
    "I rode out alone; saw",
    "a doe and two fawns",
    "which I did not",
    "touch, as we have",
    "more than enough",
    "meat; coming home",
    "struck a covey of grouse",
    "and killed 12, as",
    "they are good eating",
    "for a change.",
    "Meanwhile M.",
    "saw a black bear",
    "up a tree and",
    "shot him; by bad",
    "luck I was not",
    "with him."
   ],
